# Louvain non-termination regression (rete 0.3.3 and earlier never return from
# build on this graph). 15 triples, 7 nodes, so 2m = 30: two nodes swap between
# two communities whose gains are exactly equal (10/30 and 12/30) but round one
# ulp apart in floating point. The smallest hang found: none at <= 13 triples in
# 100M random graphs. Found by dev/louvain-hang (seed 2959679, LH_MAXT=26 LH_MAXN=20).
